<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Points_Mean_Prizes.21">Points Mean Prizes!</span></h2>
<p>Typically, for any given contest, the system is likely to be:
</p>
<ul><li> 1st place: 15 points</li>
<li> 2nd place: 10 points</li>
<li> 3rd place: 5 points</li></ul>
<p>Please see the <a href="#Frequently_Asked_Questions">FAQ</a> below for more information on how the process works.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Redeeming_Points">Redeeming Points</span></h2>
<p>To exchange your points for a prize, please PM <b><a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="http://social.bioware.com/52/">Sunjammer</a></b> on Bioware Social Network.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="The_Prizes">The Prizes</span></h2>
<p>The prizes we have available are <b>subject to change</b> and we hope to continually introduce new prizes. Work offered by fellow community members may become unavailable if that individual becomes busy, I'm sure you can understand we cant always provide our time limitlessly.
</p>
