<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Our_Sponsors">Our Sponsors</span></h2>
<h3><span class="mw-headline" id="Dragon_Age_Nexus">Dragon Age Nexus</span></h3>
<p><a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="http://www.dragonagenexus.com/">Dragon Age Nexus</a> hosts a wide variety of mods and content for Dragon Age Origins. With advanced browsing and searching, as well as forums and image sharing, its a cool place to be&#160;;)
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Frequently_Asked_Questions">Frequently Asked Questions</span></h2>
<p><b>What if two people want and can afford the same prize but theres limited availability?</b>
</p>
<ul><li> We generally give out a prize as soon as someone asks for it. If there is limited availability on a prize you're interested in, then PM us expressing your interest. We will reserve a prize until the next contest ends, at which point whoever reserved the prize may get it provided they have enough points. If two people reserve a prize ahead of contest results, then whoever placed highest in that contest will get the prize - the other person must choose another prize.</li></ul>
<p><b>May I save points for use later?</b>
</p>
<ul><li> Absolutely. However, remember that prize availability can fluctuate. </li></ul>
<p><b>I have too few points to get a prize</b>
</p>
<ul><li> Be sure to enter future contests to gather more points and save them up to cash them in for prizes later!</li></ul>
